{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a jewelry student who has come to Diamond City. You have inherited a house with a workshop in the basement. Can you revive the family business and become a real jeweler?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond City is a city in a mountainous area where diamonds and other precious stones are mined. You live in the suburbs. Take local transportation to downtown and meet your first client, Harvey Brook.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/extras/2c188bc61e1e14fca9522b243a224e66.avif?t=1757410567\" data-has-big width=1560 height=296 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/extras/09ce47e16cf4a8a46f07ebef6a5516d5.poster.avif?t=1757410567\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/extras/09ce47e16cf4a8a46f07ebef6a5516d5.webm?t=1757410567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/extras/09ce47e16cf4a8a46f07ebef6a5516d5.mp4?t=1757410567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use real jeweler\u2019s tools to solder the chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/extras/a081ee371b29bf5efda5c5dbc16373c8.avif?t=1757410567\" data-has-big width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/extras/86e9abd30cdb683f66a650f7d170c4b2.poster.avif?t=1757410567\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494290/